  "sourceTitle": "ImaJev-4b: I spent 15 days fine-tuning a 4B model to make business decisions from text and photos, and it just ranked #1 of 91 on JevBench & ahead of GPT-5.6 Luna on DecisionBench",
  "sourceBodyHash": "99eb8c9c409ba6c76cbe3acb657437cb6fa94e713a207c1e9bb435db34502779",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
